OL,3,GNEWSAArmy officers cleared over
OL,4,Ahandling of sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo serving Army officers have been
OL,7,Fcleared of failing to properly deal
OL,8,Fwith abuse allegations made by a
OL,9,Fteenage soldier who took her own life.
OL,11,FMaj James Hook and Col Samantha
OL,12,FShepherd were on trial at Military
OL,13,FCourt Centre at Catterick Garrison in
OL,14,FNorth Yorkshire, in connection with the
OL,15,Fhandling of concerns raised by Gunner
OL,16,FJaysley Beck, from Cumbria.
OL,18,FThe 19-year-old took her own life at
OL,19,FLarkhill Camp in Wiltshire in 2021
OL,20,Fafter former Battery Sgt Michael Webber
OL,21,F"pinned her down" and sexually
OL,22,Fassaulted her.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
