OL,3,GNEWSAArmy officers cleared over
OL,4,Ahandling of sexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA board - which consisted of an Air
OL,7,FCommodore, a Royal Navy captain and an
OL,8,FArmy colonel - returned a not guilty
OL,9,Fverdict for both officers following a
OL,10,Ftwo-day hearing.
